=Generate YouTube metadata for a Hero English podcast episode.

Episode Details:
- Topic: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.Topic }}
- Topic Description: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.Topic }}
- Target Keywords: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.Keywords }}
- English Level: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.Level }}

The output must:
- Include title, description, and tags
- Be written for elementary English learners (A1–A2)
- Use simple, clear, slow English
- Follow the exact rules and structure defined in the system prompt
- Output ONLY valid JSON

